# Canonical clippy allow-list baseline (gate:12, the NoBaselinesGate analogue).
# One lint name per line — every `= "allow"` (or `level = "allow"`) entry under
# [workspace.lints.clippy] in Cargo.toml. gate:12 fails if the live allow-list
# differs from this file, so the "justified ratchet backlog" cannot quietly grow
# into a de-facto baseline: adding/removing an allow MUST also update this file
# in the same commit (visible, reviewable). CONSTITUTION §0.
